orgia,serif;margin:0 0 10px"><span>The retired generals sounding the alarm =
over the West Bank</span></h2><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,ser=
if;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span style=3D"font-weight:700">Azam, you re=
cently accompanied a group of retired Israeli officials and military office=
rs to the West Bank. How did that happen=3F And what did you see=3F</span><=
/p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15=
px"><span>One of these generals had known our colleague Ronen Bergman for a=
 long time and asked whether we=E2=80=99d like to come along. We saw villag=
es where settler violence has cleared entire communities. You walk around a=
nd it=E2=80=99s like a ghost town. There are the remnants of shepherding pe=
ns and homes. But no people.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px ge=
orgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>The most striking thing to me=
 was the language these former military officers used to describe what=E2=
=80=99s happening. They openly called it =E2=80=9Cethnic cleansing.=E2=80=
=9D They also referred to =E2=80=9CJewish terrorism=E2=80=9D =E2=80=94 the =
idea that in the name of Judaism settlers terrorize innocent farmers, women=
 and children, and sometimes even kill them.</span></p><p style=3D"font:nor=
mal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span style=3D"font=
-weight:700">The violence in the West Bank has unfolded in the shadow of Is=
rael=E2=80=99s post-Oct. 7 wars in Gaza, Lebanon and Iran. But it=E2=80=99s=
 not a military campaign; it=E2=80=99s a civilian campaign. What does that =
look like=3F</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;colo=
r:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Groups of settlers have been moving into the =
occupied West Bank, often into containers or trailers on the hillsides. The=
y tend to settle close to Palestinian population centers. In some cases, th=
ey attack the surrounding communities.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17=
px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>They come in with m=
asks, with guns, with bats. They torch homes, and steal livestock. The Pale=
stinians know that they=E2=80=99re not allowed to be armed, and that if the=
y fight back, in many cases the military will show up and defend the Israel=
is, even when they are the aggressors.</span></p><table border=3D"0" cellpa=
dding=3D"0" cellspacing=3D"0" style=3D"width:100%"><tbody><tr><td style=3D"=
