licit in this violence. How so=3F</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25=
px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>When they call the gover=
nment =E2=80=9Ccomplicit,=E2=80=9D they mean several things. In some cases =
soldiers actually join forces with settlers to attack a village. There was =
a highly publicized incident of settlers camped outside Palestinian homes i=
n a village called Qusra, and one video shows a soldier </span><a href=3D"h=
ttps://nl.nytimes.com/f/newsletter/c2Vjo3v3IFLiE3jkRHzbuA~~/AAAAARA~/XWNsBm=
