ebkit-text-decoration:underline;text-decoration:underline">praying with the=
 settlers</a><span>.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,se=
rif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>These officials also point out that I=
sraeli intelligence in the West Bank is so good that it=E2=80=99s very hard=
 for a Palestinian to pull off any kind of attack. So their question is: Ho=
w is it that a Palestinian can=E2=80=99t do anything without the Israeli mi=
litary knowing about it, but settlers face no consequences for violence=3F<=
/span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin=
